        "original_id": "3c1c393a-60f1-5445-b3a6-d02923e0e243",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Highland station, Austin, Texas\n- Systems: Capital MetroRail\n- Places: Highland Mall\n- Topics: station location, mall opening\n\nFacts:\n- In 1971, Highland Mall opened as Austin's first suburban shopping mall.\n- Highland is a Capital MetroRail commuter rail station in Austin, Texas, USA.\n- Highland station is in northeast Austin at the intersection of Airport Boulevard and Highland Mall Boulevard.\n- Highland station is just northwest of the I-35/Highway 290 interchange across the street from Highland Mall.",
